WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Project pitch. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Defend a transparent educational budget

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: A project pitch makes assumptions, exclusions, options and uncertainty visible. It is a learning estimate, not financial advice.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Show base estimate, reserve, largest uncertainty and one lower-cost alternative on the same page.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: AP finance brief

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Teaching relationships only—not live quotes, prices, tax advice or forecasts.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Defend a transparent educational budget
